00:12:08,933 --> 00:12:13,119
Power's dependability study asks owners of three-year-old

317
00:12:13,119 --> 00:12:15,395
trucks about problems they had,

318
00:12:15,395 --> 00:12:18,406
and counts them per one hundred vehicles.

319
00:12:18,586 --> 00:12:22,095
Pickup Truck Talk's ranking weighs its own

320
00:12:22,095 --> 00:12:25,019
reporting, recalls, investigations,

321
00:12:25,019 --> 00:12:29,364
complaints, repair cost and whether problems persist

322
00:12:29,364 --> 00:12:30,951
