326
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:38,747
Both are useful,

327
00:12:38,747 --> 00:12:41,162
and neither is the whole answer.

328
00:12:41,513 --> 00:12:43,788
Look at the example of the Ram.

329
00:12:43,968 --> 00:12:46,722
A truck can have many small problems,

330
00:12:46,722 --> 00:12:48,732
like a screen that freezes,

331
00:12:48,732 --> 00:12:51,337
and rank poorly with owners who are

332
00:12:51,337 --> 00:12:51,933
annoyed.

333
00:12:52,113 --> 00:12:55,020
Another truck can have fewer problems,

334
00:12:55,020 --> 00:12:56,857
but one serious failure,

335
00:12:56,857 --> 00:12:59,765
like an engine that needs replacement,

336
00:12:59,765 --> 00:13:02,443
and rank poorly with a reporter who

337
00:13:02,443 --> 00:13:03,897
tracks repair cost.

338
00:13:04,077 --> 00:13:07,049
A smart buyer asks two questions.

339
00:13:07,229 --> 00:13:09,275
How often does it go wrong,

340
00:13:09,275 --> 00:13:11,169
and how bad is it when it

341
00:13:11,169 --> 00:13:11,548
does?

342
00:13:11,898 --> 00:13:13,894
There is also the matter of the

343
00:13:13,894 --> 00:13:14,603
model year.

344
00:13:14,783 --> 00:13:15,363
The J.

345
00:13:15,543 --> 00:13:15,694
D.

346
00:13:15,874 --> 00:13:18,926
Power study looked at twenty twenty-three model

347
00:13:18,926 --> 00:13:19,705
year trucks.

348
00:13:19,885 --> 00:13:21,517
That is not the truck you will

349
00:13:21,517 --> 00:13:22,985
buy in twenty twenty-seven.

350
00:13:23,165 --> 00:13:25,325
Companies change engines,

351
00:13:25,325 --> 00:13:29,214
transmissions and software every year or two.

352
00:13:29,394 --> 00:13:31,830
So use these studies as a signal

353
00:13:31,830 --> 00:13:33,961
about a company's direction,

354
00:13:33,961 --> 00:13:37,081
and then check the recalls and complaints

355
00:13:37,081 --> 00:13:39,364
for the exact year you want to

356
00:13:39,364 --> 00:13:39,669
buy.

357
00:13:39,849 --> 00:13:41,365
That is a free check,

358
00:13:41,365 --> 00:13:43,169
and it takes ten minutes.

359
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:45,540
And one more thing about warnings.

360
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:48,017
Every truck on this list has a

361
00:13:48,017 --> 00:13:51,003
recall history, and so does every truck

362
00:13:51,003 --> 00:13:52,535
on every other list.

363
00:13:52,715 --> 00:13:55,496
A recall is not always a reason

364
00:13:55,496 --> 00:13:57,022
to avoid a truck.

365
00:13:57,202 --> 00:13:59,085
It is a reason to check that

366
00:13:59,085 --> 00:14:00,430
the repair was done.

367
00:14:00,610 --> 00:14:02,648
When you buy a used truck,

368
00:14:02,648 --> 00:14:05,393
ask for the record of open recalls.

369
00:14:05,573 --> 00:14:07,126
When you buy a new one,

370
00:14:07,126 --> 00:14:08,882
ask whether any are known.

371
00:14:09,062 --> 00:14:12,208
The existence of a recall is normal.

372
00:14:12,388 --> 00:14:15,061
A recall that nobody fixed is the

373
00:14:15,061 --> 00:14:15,708
problem.

374
00:14:16,059 --> 00:14:18,597
You may have noticed what is missing,

375
00:14:18,597 --> 00:14:19,832
the Toyota Tundra.

376
00:14:20,012 --> 00:14:23,388
It keeps eighty and three tenths percent

377
00:14:23,388 --> 00:14:25,920
of its value after five years,

378
00:14:25,920 --> 00:14:27,777
according to iSeeCars,

379
00:14:27,777 --> 00:14:30,310
almost the same as the Tacoma.

380
00:14:30,490 --> 00:14:33,425
But Pickup Truck Talk ranked it last

381
00:14:33,425 --> 00:14:37,094
of the five full-size trucks for reliability,

382
00:14:37,094 --> 00:14:40,437
because of twin-turbo V six failures that

383
00:14:40,437 --> 00:14:43,699
in some cases required a complete engine

384
00:14:43,699 --> 00:14:44,677
replacement.

385
00:14:44,857 --> 00:14:45,507
And J.

386
00:14:45,687 --> 00:14:45,850
D.

387
00:14:46,030 --> 00:14:48,921
Power's dependability study did not list it.

388
00:14:49,271 --> 00:14:51,453
That is the lesson of this list.

389
00:14:51,633 --> 00:14:53,499
The best truck on paper depends on

390
00:14:53,499 --> 00:14:54,431
what you measure.

391
00:14:54,611 --> 00:14:56,426
If you measure resale,

392
00:14:56,426 --> 00:14:57,746
the Toyotas win.

393
00:14:57,926 --> 00:15:01,353
If you measure reliability by one source,

394
00:15:01,353 --> 00:15:02,523
the Ford wins.

395
00:15:02,703 --> 00:15:05,534
If you measure price and momentum,

396
00:15:05,534 --> 00:15:06,616
the Ram wins.

397
00:15:06,796 --> 00:15:09,339
If you measure the lowest price you

398
00:15:09,339 --> 00:15:10,574
