399
00:15:10,574 --> 00:15:11,881
the Maverick wins.

400
00:15:12,061 --> 00:15:13,949
No truck wins everything,

401
00:15:13,949 --> 00:15:16,668
and the honest answer to which truck

402
00:15:16,668 --> 00:15:19,009
is worth buying is the one that

403
00:15:19,009 --> 00:15:20,896
fits your own priorities.

404
00:15:21,247 --> 00:15:23,267
Here is a way to decide in

405
00:15:23,267 --> 00:15:24,277
five minutes.

406
00:15:24,457 --> 00:15:27,072
Write down your three priorities,

407
00:15:27,072 --> 00:15:28,499
for example price,

408
00:15:28,499 --> 00:15:29,925
resale and towing.

409
00:15:30,105 --> 00:15:32,300
Then look up the exact numbers for

410
00:15:32,300 --> 00:15:33,978
the three trucks you like,

411
00:15:33,978 --> 00:15:35,980
from the sources in this video.

412
00:15:36,160 --> 00:15:38,244
And write the warnings next to each

413
00:15:38,244 --> 00:15:38,482
one.

414
00:15:38,662 --> 00:15:41,008
A truck with one clear warning that

415
00:15:41,008 --> 00:15:42,952
you can live with is a better

416
00:15:42,952 --> 00:15:45,366
choice than a truck with no warnings

417
00:15:45,366 --> 00:15:46,974
that you could not find.

418
00:15:47,325 --> 00:15:50,854
Let's compare two figures we already saw.

419
00:15:51,034 --> 00:15:53,903
The Tacoma keeps eighty and a half

420
00:15:53,903 --> 00:15:57,110
percent of its value after five years,

421
00:15:57,110 --> 00:16:00,991
and the Ford F-one-fifty keeps sixty-one point

422
00:16:00,991 --> 00:16:01,413
four.

