00:16:01,593 --> 00:16:04,188
That is a gap of about nineteen

424
00:16:04,188 --> 00:16:04,774
points.

425
00:16:04,954 --> 00:16:07,466
On a truck that costs fifty thousand

426
00:16:07,466 --> 00:16:09,977
dollars, nineteen points is a lot of

427
00:16:09,977 --> 00:16:11,302
money you get back,

428
00:16:11,302 --> 00:16:12,627
or do not get back,

429
00:16:12,627 --> 00:16:13,604
when you sell.

430
00:16:13,784 --> 00:16:16,733
So resale is not a small detail.

431
00:16:16,913 --> 00:16:18,095
For many buyers,

432
00:16:18,095 --> 00:16:20,237
it is the largest cost in the

433
00:16:20,237 --> 00:16:22,822
