518
00:19:18,644 --> 00:19:20,237
A buyer should ask why,

519
00:19:20,237 --> 00:19:22,730
and should not assume that a falling

520
00:19:22,730 --> 00:19:24,461
market means a bad truck.

521
00:19:24,641 --> 00:19:27,019
It may mean that fewer people need

522
00:19:27,019 --> 00:19:27,299
one.

523
00:19:27,479 --> 00:19:29,700
If you are one of the people

524
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:30,731
who need one,

525
00:19:30,731 --> 00:19:32,634
