528
00:19:36,810 --> 00:19:39,318
Finally, here is how the five picks

529
00:19:39,318 --> 00:19:42,041
fit together for a household with more

530
00:19:42,041 --> 00:19:43,044
than one need.

531
00:19:43,224 --> 00:19:45,794
A family that wants one truck for

532
00:19:45,794 --> 00:19:48,520
