533
00:19:48,520 --> 00:19:50,701
perfect, and that is normal.

534
00:19:50,881 --> 00:19:53,481
The Ford gives mainstream choice,

535
00:19:53,481 --> 00:19:56,082
the Ram gives value and momentum,

536
00:19:56,082 --> 00:19:58,288
and the Tacoma gives resale.

537
00:19:58,468 --> 00:20:00,759
Pick the strength you will use every

538
00:20:00,759 --> 00:20:03,113
week, accept the warning that you can

539
00:20:03,113 --> 00:20:05,086
live with, and ignore the rest.

540
00:20:05,266 --> 00:20:07,533
A truck that fits ninety percent of

541
00:20:07,533 --> 00:20:09,736
your week is better than a perfect

542
00:20:09,736 --> 00:20:11,291
truck you cannot afford.

543
00:20:11,642 --> 00:20:13,464
And a short word on timing.

544
00:20:13,644 --> 00:20:16,176
The numbers in this video come from

545
00:20:16,176 --> 00:20:19,287
reports published during twenty twenty-six.

546
00:20:19,467 --> 00:20:23,047
Prices, incentives and sales change from month

547
00:20:23,047 --> 00:20:25,459
to month, so use our figures as

548
00:20:25,459 --> 00:20:26,782
a starting point,

549
00:20:26,782 --> 00:20:29,740
and confirm the current numbers on the

550
00:20:29,740 --> 00:20:30,752
day you shop.

551
00:20:30,932 --> 00:20:32,949
Ask for the price in writing,

552
00:20:32,949 --> 00:20:35,593
ask for the warranty terms in writing,

553
00:20:35,593 --> 00:20:37,819
and compare the same trim at two

554
00:20:37,819 --> 00:20:39,488
dealers on the same day.

555
00:20:39,668 --> 00:20:42,226
That small habit is worth more than

556
00:20:42,226 --> 00:20:42,884
any list.

557
00:20:43,235 --> 00:20:45,096
So what should you check before you

558
00:20:45,096 --> 00:20:46,532
buy in twenty twenty-seven?

559
00:20:46,712 --> 00:20:49,739
First, the recalls on the exact model

560
00:20:49,739 --> 00:20:50,148
year.

561
00:20:50,328 --> 00:20:53,685
Second, the full price with the destination

562
00:20:53,685 --> 00:20:53,997
fee.

563
00:20:54,177 --> 00:20:57,335
Third, the five-year resale value.

564
00:20:57,515 --> 00:21:00,831
